    "kind": "definition_of_done",
    "summary": "- `DELETE /v1/customers/{id}` soft-deletes the customer (204, or 409 `has_active_subscriptions`). Deleted customers return 404 everywhere in the API, and their emails are reusable.\n- Invoices and payments keep a `customer` stub with `\"deleted\": true`. `POST /v1/customers/{id}/restore` works within 30 days, and `store.PurgeDeletedCustomers(now)` removes customers deleted more than 30 days ago.\n- New tests cover each behavior, and `go build`, `go test` and `go vet` pass.",
